tive task-loading loop with a stream pipeline that\\nparses each saved line and filters malformed records.\\n\\nCollect into an ArrayList to preserve the method\u0027s existing mutable-list\\nbehavior while keeping task order unchanged.\\n\\nVerified with the full JUnit suite, Checkstyle, and all UI test-plan cases.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"05adccacab35f9fed8734881abf063ff7efbf30a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from rayyngg/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add Java Assertions","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"cd3d5fc22325802ae2a7372d6a45615ea04f2c19","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Resolve the Storage parsing conflict while preserving the refactored\nrecord validation and master branch assertions.\n\nAdd coverage for ignoring task records with blank descriptions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"9fe938a9f8c1ef1eaa29f07b12e62c04e0715f6f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from rayyngg/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Merge branch-A-CodeQuality into master","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d3d916d289829e75de8615677ec4bea8fb31500c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from rayyngg/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Storage: Load tasks with streams","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"ef925cb5cebf6d602bce5e224da372b0a2316f26","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add task tagging support","messageBody":"Tasks need lightweight labels so users can group deadlines, events, and todos after creating them. Add a tag command that attaches one or more unique labels to a task and reports the created tag clearly.\n\nPersist optional tag fields while remaining compatible with existing task files, display hashtag-formatted labels in task output, document the command in help, and 